.daml/
*.dar
# …except the interface DARs the build reads and the previous version it upgrades
# from. They are 2.5 MB in total, they are inputs rather than outputs, and without
# them `daml build` cannot resolve its data-dependencies on a fresh clone or in CI.
!dars/*.dar
node_modules/
.env
.env.local
dist/

log/

# secrets
.env
.env.*
*.token
!*.example

.vercel

# recorder output: the raw silent capture is an intermediate, the narrated mp4 ships
media/*.webm
log/*.log

.env*

# local sandbox run (scripts/local.mjs)
parties.local.json

# DecMan LocalNet run (localnet/decman-setup.mjs): node data, keys, generated parties
parties.localnet.json
localnet/decman/
localnet/ctl/
media/.capture/
